# Local development data. Real SeaTable exports live here and are never
# committed: a .dtable carries the base's full contents, including the
# collaborator list with real e-mail addresses.
dev/
*.dtable
# ...except the hand-built test fixture, which the package ships and the
# tests read through system.file(). It contains no real data.
!inst/extdata/*.dtable

